# Of the reference material only our own work is tracked: the notes and indexes, the transcribed
# tables and the extraction script. The downloaded documents, drawings, photographs, the DWG and
# the bodies extracted from it stay out. The pipeline needs reference/cad/ to rebuild the model;
# the built model is in web/public/models/.
reference/**
!reference/**/
!reference/**/*.md
!reference/**/*.csv
!reference/**/*.json
!reference/cad/extract_sab.py
!reference/cad/vertex_preview.png
